WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
My brother was two years older. He cared for me and took me out.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:06.760
On the bus home, we met someone unexpected.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.080
At the time, we thought there was something wrong with him.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:14.800
Why? His gospel vest said, “God loves the world.”

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.800
“Jesus is the Savior.” We thought he must be crazy.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.760
He smiled warmly and handed out gospel leaflets on the bus.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:28.100
“Come hear the gospel.” On a bus! We found it off-putting.

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:34.220
But he was polite and smiling, and we had been taught manners.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:38.140
So we smiled back and said, “Thank you, thank you.”

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.160
We took a leaflet and put it in a pocket. That was all.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:45.140
We had no real intention of believing or doing anything.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.780
We pocketed it, and the two of us got off the bus.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:51.760
Who was that brother? Brother Qian Xicai.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.060
We will always be grateful to that brother.

00:00:55.940 --> 00:01:00.180
It was a life-saving leaflet. Without it…

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:04.440
Our whole family would have missed the opportunity. Back home…

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:09.820
We had forgotten it. Mom found it while checking our laundry pockets.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:14.360
She saw the leaflet: “Please come and hear the gospel.”

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:17.800
“Come hear the gospel,” an introduction to…

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:23.000
The Creator of heaven and earth, the one true and living God.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.800
Mom’s eyes lit up: “Isn’t this the One I’ve worshipped for decades?”

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:33.060
Holding incense, she would say, “True God, please accept this offering.”

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:36.280
“False gods, stay away. I want the true and living God.”

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:40.780
The leaflet offered to introduce the one true and living God.

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:45.020
After reading it, she discussed it with Dad.

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:49.600
“Let’s go listen.” She asked us children to go together, too.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:56.140
At that time, under the Lord’s sovereignty, my parents were about 36 or 37.

00:01:56.140 --> 00:02:01.700
Dad was beginning to have trouble with his eyes. When asked to go…

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:06.020
He immediately said, “Yes! Something strange has been happening.”

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:11.480
“When I look at the stars in the sky, they turn into crosses.”

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:17.600
“I rub my eyes, but I still see crosses.”

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:22.140
“Perhaps there is a connection. Let’s go listen!” And so we went.

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:27.760
That was God’s wisdom. Our Taiwanese family was sincere…

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:33.000
And simple, but very superstitious. What happened next?

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:38.360
All four of us: our parents, my brother and me. We were 17 and 15.

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:44.960
It was 1963. I will never forget—around Lunar New Year in February…

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:48.520
There were three gospel meetings. My brother remembers clearly.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:52.000
Three meetings, with two gospel preachers. The first…

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:55.700
The first was Brother Zheng Baozhi, who was serving in Tainan.

00:02:56.220 --> 00:03:00.540
On the second and third days, it was our dear Brother Liu Sui.

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:03.340
I’ve been talking all this time, and that was only the introduction!

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:11.100
Why have we never forgotten, even after 57 years?

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:14.140
We had the best spiritual fathers. The seed they gave us…

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:20.680
Was good seed. It was pure seed.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:26.940
It was healthy teaching and the pure word of the Lord.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:31.420
We were regenerated, not of corruptible seed…

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:36.840
But of incorruptible seed, through the living and abiding word.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:41.780
This word was the gospel preached to us. We did not understand everything.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:48.280
Brother Liu’s words were so profound. Yet, understood or not, we believed.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:53.760
On March 2, 1963, all four of us…

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:59.020
At No. 36, Datong North Road, Sanchong.

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:03.680
Our family of four was there. In all, 72 people were baptized that day.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:08.060
All four of us were baptized there. From then on…

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:13.900
What moved us even more was what we discovered after baptism…
